      "title": "Museveni Urges Somalia to Unite Against Al-Shabaab, Opens Door for Ugandan Coffee Exports - SoftPower News",
      "link": "https://softpower.ug/museveni-urges-somalia-to-unite-against-al-shabaab-opens-door-for-ugandan-coffee-exports/",
